#. type: Title ##
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:191
#, no-wrap
msgid "Content block"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:194
msgid ""
"Reusable content bricks for **containers** (diary, notes, …). `block_type` "
"is technical only; semantics attach via `components[]` tags (not a nested "
"JSONB `components` column — tags stay `text[]`, fields merge flat into "
"`body`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:198
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Concept | Entity         | Component       |\n"
"| ------- | -------------- | --------------- |\n"
"| Block   | `type=content` | `content_block` |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:206
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Body / column     | Role                                                             |\n"
"| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `body.block_type` | `text` \\| `image` \\| `audio` \\| `video` \\| `link_card` \\| `file` |\n"
"| `body.parent_id`  | Container entity id (`diary_entry`; later: note)                 |\n"
"| `body.sort_order` | View order; blocks have no semantic precedence                   |\n"
"| `body.url`        | Resource locator for non-text types; null for text               |\n"
"| `content` column  | Text body or media caption                                       |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:208
msgid ""
"Optional semantic components on the same row (`components[]`; fields merge "
"into flat `body`):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:216
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Component         | `body` fields                                                                                       |\n"
"| ----------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `limbic`          | `valence`, `arousal`, `intensity`, optional provenance (`kind`, `legacy_id`, …)                     |\n"
"| `narrative`       | `significance`, optional `period_*` / `status` / `legacy_id`                                        |\n"
"| `dream`           | `source_limbic_ids`, `source_conversation_ids`, `episodic_snippets`, `legacy_id`                    |\n"
"| `semantic_ref`    | `entity_id`（指向 `primary_component=semantic_memory` 的 entity）                                   |\n"
"| `semantic_memory` | `memory_kind`, `status`, `source_conversations`, `observed_at`, `occurred_at`, optional `legacy_id` |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:218
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Container end-state:** `diary_entry` is the only content-block container. Dream / limbic / autobiographical memories are `content_block` rows with the matching semantic tag under the dated diary for that CST day (agent default private world for sleep writes).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:221
msgid ""
"**LLM:** ToolSet `content-block` (`@freeanima/features/content-block/"
"domain`) — `content_block_create` / `update` / `delete` / `get` / `list` / "
"`search` / `reorder`. `list` requires container `parent_id`; optional "
"`component=limbic|narrative|semantic_ref|dream` filters semantic tags; "
"`reorder` batch-updates `sort_order`. Optional `world_id`; `parent_id` / "
"block `id` infer world."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:221
msgid ""
"**Search filters:** `parent_id`, `block_type`, `client_op_id` (whitelist "
"shared by `entity_search` / store)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:222
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dream (sleep pipeline)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:225
msgid ""
"Nightly creative narratives (append-only, at most one dream block per diary "
"day):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:229
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Concept | Entity         | Components                |\n"
"| ------- | -------------- | ------------------------- |\n"
"| Dream   | `type=content` | `content_block` + `dream` |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:231
msgid ""
"Writes go to the **agent** subject's **`default_private_world_id`**: ensure "
"that day's `diary_entry`, then insert a text `content_block` tagged `dream`. "
"Calendar day comes from the parent diary `entry_at` (CST), not a `dream_day` "
"body field."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:235
msgid ""
"**Read:** `diary_get` / `content_block_list` / `content_block_search` with "
"`component=dream`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:235
msgid ""
"**UI:** Shell `/diary` shows dream blocks with a read-only「梦境」label (no "
"independent `/dream` module)."
msgstr ""

