msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:238
#, no-wrap
msgid "Vault module (Estate)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:241
msgid ""
"Encrypted credentials in two libraries (**User** + **Agent**), ECS "
"components `vault_config` + `vault_item`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:246
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Concept | Entity         | Component      |\n"
"| ------- | -------------- | -------------- |\n"
"| Config  | `type=content` | `vault_config` |\n"
"| Item    | `type=content` | `vault_item`   |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:251
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Library | Crypto mode       | Decrypt location              | Headless inject                     |\n"
"| ------- | ----------------- | ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n"
"| User    | `master_password` | Client (Shell)                | No — Chat unlock box or `/vault` UI |\n"
"| Agent   | `machine`         | Habitat (`agent-machine.key`) | Yes — cron / tools                  |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:253
msgid ""
"Privacy fields live in `body.secrets_enc` + `body.dek_wrapped`; metadata "
"(title, url, username, custom field **names**) is plaintext for search."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:258
msgid ""
"**SAP:** `vault.*` — Shell defaults `subject_kind: user`; ToolSet defaults "
"agent world."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:258
msgid ""
"**UI:** shell `/vault` (`@freeanima/satellite-vault`); bundled Chat has a "
"dedicated master-password unlock (not a chat message)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:258
msgid ""
"**LLM:** ToolSet `vault` — Habitat-only (not MCP): metadata list/search/get; "
"`vault_create` / `vault_update` / `vault_delete` (Agent library seal for "
"create/update); credentials via `terminal_run` / `code_execute` `secrets[]` "
"(child env only) or `browser_type` `secret` (typed into page; redacted in "
"tool results); never plaintext secrets in tool results or Habitat "
"`process.env`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:258
msgid ""
"**Config:** Runtime PG settings may use `vault(\"item_id\", \"field\")` "
"(Agent library) or `env(\"KEY\")` (legacy `credential()` removed). Bootstrap "
"`config.yaml` cannot resolve `vault()` — use `env()` or plaintext before "
"PostgreSQL is up."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:260
msgid ""
"Legacy pass (`~/.password-store`) is **not** deleted on disk; migrate "
"entries manually via Shell UI."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:261 messages/po4a/en.xml:222
#: messages/po4a/en.xml:234 messages/po4a/en.xml:613
#, no-wrap
msgid "Search"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:264
msgid ""
"Entity **list** (deterministic browse) and **search** (relevance ranking) "
"are separate ports:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:269
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port                      | Role                                                           |\n"
"| ------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `EntityStorePort.list`    | Structural filters; stable sort                                |\n"
"| `EntitySearchPort.search` | Hard filters + optional text query; hybrid FTS/trigram via RRF |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:271
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Scope:** default `world_id`; `global: true` requires an explicit accessible-world allowlist (`resolveWorldsAccessibleBySubject`: public + owned private + grant-readable worlds).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:273
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Component filters:** whitelisted per `primary_component` (e.g. `task_item`: `status`, `list_id`, `tag_ids`, `due_today`). Top-level `tag_ids` filter applies across components. Arbitrary JSONPath is forbidden.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:275
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Tools / API:** `entity_search` (LLM/MCP) and `createTypedHabitatClient().call(\"entity.searchGet\")` / `createTypedHabitatClient().call(\"entity.searchPost\")` (REST `GET /rpc/v1/entity/searchGet` | `POST /rpc/v1/entity/searchPost`) share `EntitySearchPort`. Task UI search box uses the same Habitat RPC endpoint.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:277
msgid ""
"See memory hybrid search in [`memory.md`](../cognition/memory.md) for FTS "
"operator syntax; entity search reuses the same query builder."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:279
#, no-wrap
msgid "**FTS index:** same `fts_segmented` + jieba write path as semantic memory (`resolveFtsSegmentedForWrite` on entity create/update). Legacy rows imported before this column may lack segmentation; run Habitat **FTS** rebuild (`onlyMissing`) to backfill `entities.fts_segmented` so jieba query tokens align with the GIN index.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:280
#, no-wrap
msgid "Future migration map"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/entity-model.md:293
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Legacy table                   | Target                                                                                                                     |\n"
"| ------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `dream_memory` / `dream_entry` | `content_block` + `dream`（parent = dated `diary_entry`；**done**；独立 `/dream` UI / ToolSet 已退役）                     |\n"
"| `semantic_memory`              | `primary_component=semantic_memory`（独立 entity；**done**）                                                               |\n"
"| `autobiographical_memory`      | `content_block` + `narrative`（parent = dated `diary_entry`；**done**）                                                    |\n"
"| `limbic_memory`                | `content_block` + `limbic`（parent = dated `diary_entry`；**done**）                                                       |\n"
"| `diary_entry` single body      | Container + child `content_block`s (**done**; migration clears container `content`)                                        |\n"
"| Global temporal digests        | `primary_component=temporal_summary`（day/month/year；见 [`temporal-summary.md`](../cognition/temporal-summary.md)）       |\n"
"| `tasks` (legacy)               | `task_item` (when explicitly migrated)                                                                                     |\n"
"| `config.yaml email.accounts`   | `email_account` (see [`scripts/archive/migrate-email-to-entities.ts`](../../scripts/archive/migrate-email-to-entities.ts)) |\n"
"| `memory_references`            | relationship table (future)                                                                                                |\n"
msgstr ""

